      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phillipsburg%2C_Kansas",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1939, Phillipsburg hosted the world’s first cooperative oil refinery, operated by the Consumer’s Cooperative Association until 1992.",
